<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41226" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-τᾰγή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτάσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ταγμα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				13.4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Es.</u>
				1.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝόμων ἐπιταγαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.70
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἐ. δυσχερῶς φέροντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					21.6.1
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>imposition</i> of taxes, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἐ. τῶν εἰσφορῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp. of
			oracles or divine commands, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἐπιταγήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1153
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Athens</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἐ. τοῦ θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>JHS</u>
					26.28
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἐ. τοῦ αἰωνίου θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
					16.26
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				7.6
			</span></i>.</div>
